  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f6373ca4-37f5-41dd-8899-62a0d0e8ec69-image.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 62px;\" /></p><p>Acceleration of the block&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;(Here the block is retarding)</p><p>Now, using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />On integrating, we get</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>v</mi></msubsup><mi>v</mi><mo>d</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
